- ## 使用示例
- ### 获取股票K线
- ```python
- import baostock as bs
- import pandas as pd
- lg = bs.login()
- rs = bs.query_history_k_data_plus("sh.600000", "date,close", start_date='2025-01-01', end_date='2025-03-01')
- data = []
- while rs.next():
-     data.append(rs.get_row_data())
- print(data)
- bs.logout()
